# Soft Voting: Selects the class with the highest average probability.
# AdaBoost: Improves weak learners by focusing on incorrect predictions.
# GBM: Builds trees sequentially to correct previous errors.
# XGBoost: An optimized and efficient gradient boosting algorithm.
# Accuracy: Measures the percentage of correct predictions.
# Precision: Measures the correctness of positive predictions.
# Recall: Measures correctly identified actual positive samples.
# F1 Score: Represents the balance between precision and recall.
# Confusion Matrix: Compares actual and predicted class labels.
# Iris Dataset: Contains 150 flowers from three species with four features.


